    description: Some("An unreleased game built around the AndroMan robot — a small white robot that trundled across a floor mat while you played. On screen you lead AndroMan through underground mine mazes, dodging aliens and dropping time bombs, then pilot down a 3-D tunnel past swarming Moon Bats before heading home with the minerals you have dug out."),
